Exact divisor-sheet theorem
  wall coordinate: 7x=h/d reduced
  exact owners: S_d(A)={a in A:d|a}
  owner-set columns: k mod 7g, g=gcd(S)
  column count: N_A(S)=7 sum_(T subset A\S) (-1)^|T| gcd(g,T)
  parity count: N_eta=7 sum_T (-1)^|T| E_eta(gcd(g,T),t)
  E_0(h,t)=c ceil(delta/2), E_1(h,t)=c floor(delta/2)
  where c=gcd(h,t), delta=h/c
  signed word: sum_k [P_m-( {tk/(7g)} )-P_m+( {tk/(7g)} )]/t
  least representative: tau_D(r)=r+7g(floor((D-r)/(7g))+1)
  fixed-word envelope: max_r |C_A,S(r)|/tau_D(r)
  primitive-pair bound: 135/1372
  single-owner color-cube edge bound: 51/686
  adjacent-pin paired ranges: {1: (Fraction(-1, 7), Fraction(11, 98)), 2: (Fraction(-1, 7), Fraction(1, 7)), 3: (Fraction(-13, 98), Fraction(45, 343)), 4: (Fraction(-13, 98), Fraction(15, 98))}
  singleton: -N/(14t)<=G_S<=11N/(196t)<11/28
  pair: |G_S|<=N/(14t)<1/4
  divisor charge: M_r=sum_(k>=r)(-1)^(k-r) binom(k,r) I_k
  where I_k=7 sum_(|T|=k) gcd(T)
  universal proper-sheet bound: |G_S|<=135 N_A(S)/(1372 t)<945/1372
  phase-locked tail: A_g=(g-4,...,g), S=(g)
  t=2g drift: C_2(g+84)=C_2(g)+62/49; G_S -> 31/4116
  positive cap refuter: g=33, t=66, C_2=53/98, G_S=53/6468
  t=4g drift: C_4(g+84)=C_4(g)-149/49; G_S -> -149/16464
  planar pair ray: A=(g,2g-3,2g-2,2g-1,2g), S=(g,2g), t=3g
  on g=11 mod 84: C(g+84)=C(g)+797/343; G_S -> 797/86436
  total swept walls: 954471
  affine K_8,7 fiber checks: 906171

Affine colored K_8,7 fiber
  h=a+jd with a in U_d and j in Z_7
  A_e^+(j)=floor(ea/d)+ej mod 7
  A_e^-(j)=A_e^+(j)-1_[d|e]
  A_2t(j)=2A_t(j)+floor(2{ta/d}) mod 7
  score: pointed rainbow-completion switch, not a crossing count
  reflection: W_S(-k;b)=W_S(k;R(b)), R(b)=-b-1
  actual stationary pin 0 reflects to adjacent pin 6, so no cancellation

